# The Trespasser's help as it is picked up: the game's banner and its help text come up on the HUD's panel, and its voice with them
# (a tester had neither, 0.1.15 on PC VR: the panel's text was vanishing). Run on Aridia without the tool, QUEST_SIM_NEAR=1005 with
# QUEST_SIM_NEAR_AT=0.2,0: he takes it as he is put there, about frame 2340. The game's help starts two seconds after the first
# direction pressed (help.c), so the stick is tapped as he lands on the level, in time.
600 y 1
606 y 0
2140 left_y -0.8
2150 left_y 0
2180 left_y -0.8
2190 left_y 0
2500 shot a
2650 shot b
2800 shot c
2950 shot d
3100 shot e
